    {
      "post_id": "544337597837766657",
      "text": "@JeffWaksman @jonahkeri yes...because only the ppl with the $$ are the \"really needy\"...such a non real life way to look at things",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:46:11 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443369006567342e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544332121545129984",
      "text": "@jonahkeri in all fairness it looks like they might have updated the story after you tweeted and before I read it… Maybe the case…",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:24:25 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432204564413235e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544319011765239810",
      "text": "@ctw78 no",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:32:20 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443187680681779e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544317566374907904",
      "text": "@jonahkeri This seems mostly like a computer automated thing...",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:26:35 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443173010642084e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544322231946735616",
      "text": "@pat_stack @jonahkeri @dandrezner @Uber Drivers *always* have the moral agency to offer to give rides for free, regardless of surge pricing",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:45:07 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443220774663168e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544337834686283776",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri Why aren't you mad at the regular yellow cab drivers who refuse to pick anyone up in Sydney today?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:47:07 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433759783776666e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544322012228120577",
      "text": "@pat_stack @jonahkeri @dandrezner @Uber is designed to solve a problem about maximizing efficiency under normal circumstances.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:44:15 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443218017914921e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544321352136916992",
      "text": "@JeffWaksman @jonahkeri in such a scenario, the villain is not uber, but the driver who keep the meter running when life is at stake (2/2)",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:41:38 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443211577687081e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544326076131205120",
      "text": "@pat_stack @jonahkeri @dandrezner @Uber whole point of surge pricing is: many want 2 be w family now. Why *ration* rides now of all times?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:00:24 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443232554575667e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544338528793280512",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri Prices are not punishment, they are INFORMATION. Without them, markets become dysfunctional. See: Union, Soviet.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:49:53 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433759783776666e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544339942445305856",
      "text": "@JeffWaksman @jonahkeri what does day to day at the Bronx have to do with a specific terrorist situation?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:55:30 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443394411424809e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544328023890472960",
      "text": "@pat_stack @jonahkeri @dandrezner @Uber The higher the price more likely such a decision would be made. Why do u think ur price is \"better\"?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:08:08 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443278094944256e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544327809494425600",
      "text": "@pat_stack @jonahkeri @dandrezner @Uber Driver probably wants to be w/ his or her family. But if price is high he/she might decide otherwise",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:07:17 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443274907483095e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544324229781798913",
      "text": "@sflicht @jonahkeri @dandrezner @Uber Cheap? How about regular pricing considering people are fleeing an active gunman.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:53:04 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443232554575667e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544342683897323522",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri Encourage people to do as much charity as possible, then let the marketplace fill in the gaps.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:06:23 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443422634850468e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544322557504389122",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri Except the irony is that the people helped by the surge pricing are the people Jonah thinks it hurts: The consumers.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:46:25 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443202144525394e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544318265477320706",
      "text": "@bruce_arthur @DJColdGold You don't grasp how  Uber works if you think its profiteering.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:29:22 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4431799727672934e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544341125402611712",
      "text": "@JeffWaksman @jonahkeri it's like when all those doctors without borders do what the market says and donates their supplies to poor ppl",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:00:12 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443401506089861e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544339265719894016",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri Poor people won't be able to get a cab when there's a supply shortage either. That's what you have to understand.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:52:48 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433861349686886e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544319084209664000",
      "text": "@needham_chris It's all about the fans, man.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:32:37 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4431888103757824e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544344390689239042",
      "text": "@JeffWaksman @jonahkeri same pay to drivers so they're helping \"get drivers on the street\"",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:13:10 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443440314978222e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544322647077969920",
      "text": "@pat_stack @jonahkeri @dandrezner @Uber So, to put it bluntly, fuck your moral highground. This event says 0 about ethics of surge pricing",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:46:46 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443222319467356e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544344531328856064",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri Uber has administrators that have to work/get paid. Asking them to lose money today is asking them to shut down.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:13:44 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4434439068923904e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544340263523868673",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri When there's 1 cab for every 10 people who want to get picked up in Sydney, who do they think gets picked up?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:56:46 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433994244530586e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544320717219987457",
      "text": "@bruce_arthur Its not like some driver says \"here's a great chance to make big money!\"",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:39:06 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443183026304737e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544339501381083136",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri Free markets help the poor. They create supply where otherwise there would be nothing but shortages.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:53:45 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433861349686886e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544322807283580928",
      "text": "@sflicht @jonahkeri @dandrezner @Uber The hostages certainly are. This isn't New Year's Eve or a broken train.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:47:24 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432149270063104e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544333956468834304",
      "text": "@JeffWaksman @jonahkeri why would there be no cabs?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:31:43 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443227425738629e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544318072187011072",
      "text": "@DJColdGold and \"none at all\" isn't the alternative",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:28:36 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.44317930864128e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544328399142285312",
      "text": "@pat_stack @jonahkeri @dandrezner @Uber Agree this is a minor issue in the grand scheme of things. But you're still Wrong On The Internet",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:09:38 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443280958856888e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544342135437152256",
      "text": "@JeffWaksman @jonahkeri I agree man...what other choice does Uber have in this rare and random instance....",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:04:13 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4434140581740544e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544320407617429505",
      "text": "@jonahkeri the least you can do is read the article you tweet and understand how and why their fares change.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:37:52 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443190117652398e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544338252178939904",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri When you try to pass laws banning the free market, the result is a shortage. You can't defeat supply &amp; demand.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:48:47 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433759783776666e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544317930864128000",
      "text": "@jonahkeri @bruce_arthur @mashable bruce, what is the alternative? Better to have expensive transportation than none at all",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:28:02 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443173010642084e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544317870717796352",
      "text": ".@jonahkeri The idea of surge pricing makes people uncomfortable, but it's the market providing a good to those that need it most.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:27:47 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443173010642084e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544340938982977536",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri Some rich, desperate people get cabs for $100, and then within a half hour prices drop down to normal levels.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:59:27 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433994244530586e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544322569151582208",
      "text": "@jonahkeri beyond price gouging, their use of user data has been poor at best too. Why use this service again?",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:46:28 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443216261340488e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544326264493211648",
      "text": "@pat_stack @jonahkeri @dandrezner @Uber This is a really really important basic point in economics that most people do not seem to grasp",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:01:09 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443260761312051e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544318768068177920",
      "text": "@jonahkeri stick to baseball",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:31:21 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443173010642084e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544322324929847298",
      "text": "@jonahkeri I just deleted the ap. This is BS.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:45:29 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443216261340488e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544324405133070336",
      "text": "@pat_stack @jonahkeri @dandrezner @Uber Like I said, moral obligation of drivers to give rides to those in danger is independent of pricing",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:53:45 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443242297817989e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544341405817405441",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri Some very nice people do charity work for free. But expect every business to provide free products and despair.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:01:19 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443411254026117e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544317928716632064",
      "text": "@jonahkeri No one forced to use it. They can choose a cab . . .. except they are likely scarce.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 02:28:01 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443173010642084e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544330176839307264",
      "text": "@jonahkeri I’m not sure I understand what there is to disagree w/. As your article says fares “automatically” increase when supply&lt;demand",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:16:41 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4432204564413235e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544343843232284672",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri They are the same to economists. It's all just math. You're trying to find moral meaning in math equations.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 04:11:00 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.443437419101102e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "544340020963069952",
      "text": "@blykmyk44 @jonahkeri Both are the same to economists: A supply shortage due to an external intervention in the market.",
      "timestamp": "Mon Dec 15 03:55:49 +0000 2014",
      "parent_id": 5.4433994244530586e+17,
      "post_type": "reaction"
    }
